        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/south-vinemont/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1898 Chicago businessmen formed the Alabama Vineyard and Winery Company, sparking a brief grape‑growing boom in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
