      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/south-vinemont/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A hotel built around 1900 welcomed visitors seeking mountain air, while the Vinemont Canning and Processing Company opened the same year.",
